## Why This Is Asked

The question probes practical design decisions for per-tenant data minimization in streaming pipelines, including real-time policy updates and correctness guarantees under high throughput.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant policy models and versioning
- Ingestion-time masking, redaction, and tokenization
- Hot-swapping policies with zero data loss
- Latency/throughput trade-offs; exactly-once behavior; auditability

## Code Example

